WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.333 --> 00:00:03.416
What happens when 800 of the world’s most elite footballers

00:00:03.416 --> 00:00:05.958
and their managers live together under one roof?

00:00:05.958 --> 00:00:07.666
Players stop being polite

00:00:07.666 --> 00:00:09.791
and start getting Real.

00:00:09.791 --> 00:00:10.625
This is

00:00:10.625 --> 00:00:11.708
The Champions

00:00:12.291 --> 00:00:13.958
People say I lack focus

00:00:14.458 --> 00:00:15.291
I say

00:00:15.291 --> 00:00:16.583
focus on THIS

00:00:17.166 --> 00:00:19.291
Rules are meant to be broken

00:00:19.333 --> 00:00:21.000
so is Mo Salah

00:00:21.666 --> 00:00:23.000
I’m not here to make friends

00:00:23.041 --> 00:00:24.875
I’m here to make history

00:00:25.166 --> 00:00:27.000
I’m not here to make friends either

00:00:27.208 --> 00:00:28.416
but if I did make a friend

00:00:28.416 --> 00:00:31.000
that’d be nice because I’m a bit lonely at Real

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.625
At first I thought it was a language barrier thing

00:00:33.625 --> 00:00:35.291
but now I speak some Spanish

00:00:35.291 --> 00:00:36.875
and still nobody sits with me on the bus

00:00:48.333 --> 00:00:50.291
I've been with Barca most of my life

00:00:51.083 --> 00:00:52.708
It’s more than a football club

00:00:52.708 --> 00:00:54.125
it’s really more like a

00:00:54.125 --> 00:00:54.833
family

00:00:56.125 --> 00:00:57.625
Since Don Andres left

00:00:57.625 --> 00:01:01.833
it’s important that I step up as the emotional leader of this team

00:01:01.875 --> 00:01:03.583
Sh-sh…don’t cry

00:01:03.583 --> 00:01:06.583
He’s afraid he’ll have to play a La Liga match in America

00:01:07.125 --> 00:01:10.125
It’s my job to make sure all the players on the team are happy

00:01:10.166 --> 00:01:13.500
Like I’ve noticed Messi has been a bit down since the World Cup

00:01:21.625 --> 00:01:24.958
I think he realizes he’ll never win a World Cup with Argentina

00:01:25.083 --> 00:01:27.750
So I thought it would be fun to take Messi

00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:30.333
and the rest of the squad to a pottery class!

00:01:30.333 --> 00:01:32.250
If he can’t WIN a World Cup

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:33.500
he can MAKE one!!!

00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:42.208
So, I’m making a Latin Grammy for mi amor

00:01:42.208 --> 00:01:43.041
Shakira

00:01:43.875 --> 00:01:44.958
She collects them

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:46.875
When are you going to give it to her?

00:01:46.875 --> 00:01:48.833
Whenever, wherever

00:01:48.833 --> 00:01:50.291
What are you making, Malcom?

00:01:50.291 --> 00:01:51.833
Oh, I’m making Rakitic

00:01:51.833 --> 00:01:54.125
Oh wow, the likeness is uncanny

00:01:54.125 --> 00:01:55.833
You guys, you guys, look

00:01:55.833 --> 00:01:57.416
see how happy he is

00:01:57.416 --> 00:01:58.208
Leo

00:01:58.208 --> 00:02:00.541
hold up your World Cup so I can take a picture of you with it

00:02:00.541 --> 00:02:02.125
No, Pique, it’s not for me

00:02:02.333 --> 00:02:03.750
It’s for Cristiano

00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:05.083
Of course!

00:02:05.083 --> 00:02:07.250
He’s not sad about Argentina

00:02:07.250 --> 00:02:10.000
he’s sad because he misses Ronaldo in La Liga!

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:12.166
Without the Joker, there’s no Batman

00:02:12.166 --> 00:02:14.166
Without Frazier, there’s no Ali

00:02:14.166 --> 00:02:17.375
Without Russian sports, there’s no Anti-Doping Agency

00:02:17.416 --> 00:02:18.750
These things need each other

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:21.375
I’m very excited to give Ronaldo my gift

00:02:25.333 --> 00:02:26.458
Dear Cristiano

00:02:26.458 --> 00:02:28.708
we had so many epic Clasicos together

00:02:28.708 --> 00:02:31.166
but this will always be how I remember you

00:02:31.291 --> 00:02:33.083
What is

00:02:33.083 --> 00:02:34.458
Nooooooo!!!

00:02:34.583 --> 00:02:38.250
Lionel!! You dog!

00:02:38.291 --> 00:02:40.625
Ahahahahaha!!! Suck my ball.

